# Action density visualization run
# 8^4 lattice, beta=5.6 (strong coupling for visible structure)
# Generates per-site action density with APE cooling

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 8
nY: 8
nZ: 8
nT: 8

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 5.6
Update Method: heatbath
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: hot

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 200
Number of Configurations: 3
Sweeps Between Measurements: 10
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 3
Configuration Save Frequency: 10
Save Binary Configs: off
Random Seed: 77777

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: off
Wilson Loop R Max: 2
Wilson Loop T Max: 2
Measure Polyakov: on
Measure Correlators: off
Measure Action Density: on
Cooling Steps: 40
Cooling Alpha: 1.0
Verbose Output: off

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.12
Wilson r: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 500
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-8
Solver Type: bicgstab

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 20
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 100
